<h2 id="storage">Storage</h2>
<p>The <strong>Storage</strong> pane is a very useful feature when developing progressive web apps.  This pane lets you unregister service workers and clear all caches and storage with a single button click.  <!--Check out the section below to learn more.  --></p>
